{
  "_readme": [
    "Controlled vocabulary for tagging points. Each tag lists the phrases a job",
    "description is likely to use for that competency. The scorer looks for those",
    "phrases in the JD; every hit credits the tag, and every point carrying the tag",
    "gains score. This is how 'stakeholder alignment' in a JD matches a point you",
    "tagged 'cross-functional'.",
    "",
    "Add tags freely. Keep keywords lowercase. Multi-word phrases are matched as",
    "substrings; single words are matched on word boundaries."
  ],

